Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Serpent, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike down one of his knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You just lost the rest of your\Nlife points, so the duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When my life points hit zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay Soul allowed me to\Nstay in the game by summoning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,my dark magician girl and\Nputting my fate in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you and I are in the same\Nsituation now. Each of us has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,one monster you have your\Nserpent and i have dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,girl when one is destroyed\Nthe card holder will lose now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,divine serpent end this duel if\Nshe's destroyed all hope is lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:01:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all move Y 'all move Y
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,'all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Serpent, end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:02:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary Knight Helmos,\Nactivate your Sword of Renewal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb the power of a\Nmonster from my graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, my pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the help of my Celtic Guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Helmos is safe from any monster with\N1,900 points or more! We have seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall defend he who has released us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your serpent has been stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for infinite strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lesson one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack points don't mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.53,0:02:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You dodge one blast and you think\Nyou're king of the world? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my last chance\Nto win this duel and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,free the souls of my\Nfriends from captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, heart of the cards, guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Critias and Hermos prepare to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down his divine serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel my sword of wisdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,they're too weak are you sure\Nif i were you i'd take a closer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,look what's this your knights\Nshould have been destroyed the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,moment they collided with my\Ndivine serpent wrong has your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,memory faded after all these years\Neach one of these knights has a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Critias, absorb the ability\Nof my attack guidance barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows Critias to transfer his\Nattack to any other monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So the new target of his sword of wisdom\Nwill be legendary knight Hermos. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Hermos to activate\Nhis special ability now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:04:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I must sacrifice\Nmy three magnet warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows Hermos to\Ntriple the strength of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Critias's attack and send\Nthat attack right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my two knights are\Nreflecting their attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,back and forth as its\Nstrength increases to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,infinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So that attack is stuck\Nin an endless loop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I still You'll have one knight left!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamias, merge together\Nwith Hermos and Crinius!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Divine Serpent's strength may be\Ninfinite, but that's still not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For now there's a force beyond infinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Knight of Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A power greater than my\NDivine Serpent? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself, Knight of Destiny,\Nattack his reptile with Sword of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's some kind of opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be a way out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose, darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your 10,000-year quest is finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is one more powerful soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and the great Leviathan will arise\Nfrom the depths of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your serpent has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, our duel comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, release the souls of my friends\Nand everyone else you've held captive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's all right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope we're all right out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cyclone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Central Command to USS Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received reports\Nthat a massive storm of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,unknown origins is\Nspreading across the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Upgrade all units to yellow\Nalert status immediately. And
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,maintain your current\Ncoordinates until further notice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:07:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chosen duelists, by the power of\NAtlantis, will you release me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other people\Nin here too, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, tourists of the prophecy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,my order of the Knights of Atlantis,\Ncross into the human world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, did darts get you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Yugi's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.97,0:08:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He does kind of look shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you, Yugi! Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, out of my way, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my little buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, did I miss this spiky little head?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The gang is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, the legendary\Nknights have set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you beat darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but as soon as our duel ended,\Nhe disappeared into some vortex,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have a bad feeling\Nthe worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least we'll face it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess if you guys were set free,\Nso was everyone else darts captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone was so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All the other poor schlubs\Nare still trapped. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, come outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure that thing is Atlantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, big ancient city-looking\Nthing rising up out of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.47,0:10:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say that, Vistabil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means Darts is still\Nout there and he's not gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope he's alone, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he could have woken\Nup that Leviathan thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the giant monster\Nhe kept talking about? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, from\Nwhat I saw, it ain't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how's it look out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a strange underwater\Ndisturbance has triggered a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,giant hurricane it's over\N6 000 miles in diameter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and heading towards the\Natlantic coastline as we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,speak when will it reach\Nland approximately one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,hour in one hour i don't\Nknow what the deal is but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm going up there to\Nfind out great tell us all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,about it when you get back\Nhold on guys i'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Too, you're what? Not\Nwithout me, you're not. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you three nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got back, and you're\Ngonna walk into Darts' hands again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done everything you can, so just\Nwalk away while you still have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know it's hard to see us go,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are people still\Ntrapped on the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're counting on us, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, more bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a massive hurricane\Nheading for the East Coast,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'll be there in less than one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.87,0:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, dweebs, but\NI'm going up there to find darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do me any favors, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly capable of\Nhandling this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think you're getting\Nall the credit for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have someone else to annoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to wish the Pharaoh luck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, I wanted\Nto wish you luck. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi, you promised\Nyou'd come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and kick some darts' butt, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, we're here if you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's gonna be fine, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle is reacting to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all three of my Egyptian god cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:12:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, they're back where they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but they're powerless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts must have transferred their\Nenergy to his great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hopefully when this is all over,\Nthey'll be back to their old selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we've a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or was this room wallpapered\Nwith souls a few minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That Leviathan must\Nhave beamed them all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, you'll need these. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Amos! Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, we're back in business, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is find that snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's just begun. It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm detecting some\Nsarcasm, rich boy. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, this Atlantis place\Nis a real dump, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea where Darts is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess giant green beam\Nof light marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I see him Just sitting there waiting\Nto get crushed by the awesome threesome
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this guy was creepy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Does someone want to fill me in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts must have somehow\Nleft his body behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it's just another\None of his cheap tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your answer to everything, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You really need a new catchphrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here with the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us your Leviathan couldn't awaken
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,without the souls of the\Nthree chosen duelists!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did say that, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I substituted your souls with\Nan equally powerful one. Your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.39,0:16:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fueled by the power of my spirit,\Nthe great beast has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.19,0:16:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing could pick its teeth\Nwith an Egyptian god monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's here to conquer mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's that? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That little green pimple on its nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dots! Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,when he lost our duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he must have somehow merged\Ntogether with the great Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets past you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stand here and\Ntalk to some mutated hood ornament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to blast\Nyou into next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on, you\Noversized snake in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my dark magician, my\NSummoned Skull and my Kuribu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking it with my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Flamed Swordsman, my Jinzo,\Nand good old Red Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll add Gadget\NSoldier and Force Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Tomias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with the Fang of Critias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Unstoppable Claw of Hermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Legend of Heart. And\Nnow show us your true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:18:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Knights of Atlantis. You're\Nkidding me, Yug! They're really knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, monsters attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So when do you plan on launching\Nyour real attack, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you realize what\Nyou're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tormentor, absorb Karibu's\Nability to multiply!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with the force of 10,000 knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, sword of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.19,0:19:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bend this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're wrecked! Hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have fooled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All those attacks and not one scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes no sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets worse, because I think it's\Nthat thing's turn to attack us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If that attack hits us, we're\Ngonna be fried to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Legendary Knight Tomias!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb the power of my Big Shield\NGardener and activate Full Barrier Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Leviathan is too strong.\NOur monsters. They're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,all gone We still have our three knights
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, Old Leviathan's\Ngearing up for another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,attack And this time\Nwe may not be so lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize those\Nlights. Me too. Me three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like that night.\NWhen the gateway first opened.
